OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F311A1786384095
OL,3,CFifa COO excluded from crisis talks
OL,4,Cafter criticism of World Cup sell-off
OL,5,Cplans
OL,7,FAs he lives to fight another day,
OL,8,FGianni Infantino may well have
OL,9,F"sincerely apologised" for his secret
OL,10,FWorld Cup sell-off plans, but his
OL,11,Ffleeting humility certainly did not
OL,12,Fextend to Fifa's very well-regarded
OL,13,FChief Operating Officer Kevin Lamour.
OL,15,FITV News understands Lamour was the
OL,16,Fonly Fifa management board member not
OL,17,Finvited to crisis talks in Rabat,
OL,18,FMorocco, on Wednesday. In addition, a
OL,19,Ffew others who were, did not to travel.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
