OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,312,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F311A1786384095
OL,3,CFifa COO excluded from crisis talks
OL,4,Cafter criticism of World Cup sell-off
OL,5,Cplans
OL,7,FLamour is the highest ranking
OL,8,Fexecutive to call out Infantino's
OL,9,F"project of one person".
OL,11,FIn an excoriating statement to the
OL,12,FAssociated Press last week, in which
OL,13,Fhe directly challenged his boss'
OL,14,Fclandestine behaviour, Lamour said
OL,15,Fthat Fifa staff had been "deceived"
OL,16,Fand that they "deserve better than
OL,17,Fcontempt and intimidation".
OL,26,@qD@AOUqD@WO]wD@ZOUwD@cO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
