CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F311A1786384095
OL,3,CFifa COO excluded from crisis talks
OL,4,Cafter criticism of World Cup sell-off
OL,5,Cplans
OL,7,F"A president must bring people
OL,8,Ftogether, unite them and inspire them.
OL,9,FToday, we are experiencing the
OL,10,Fopposite," he added.
OL,12,FHe concluded that if by speaking out
OL,13,F"I lose my job, then so be it. At
OL,14,Fleast I'll sleep well tonight."
OL,16,FLamour's stance was widely applauded
OL,17,Facross football for its honesty and
OL,18,Fbravery.
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@JO]uD@AOUvD@_O]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/7
