OL,5,Cplans
OL,7,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,8,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,9,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,10,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,12,FThe plans were also privately
OL,13,Fcriticised by Fifa's Secretary General
OL,14,FMattias Grafstrom.
OL,16,FIn an internal staff email this week
OL,17,Fhe described recent developments as a
OL,18,F"sad and reproachable series of
OL,19,Fevents", which is "difficult to
OL,20,Fcomprehend and accept".
OL,26,@zD@AOU{D@GO]{D@SOU|D@VO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/7
