PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F311A1786384095
OL,3,CFifa COO excluded from crisis talks
OL,4,Cafter criticism of World Cup sell-off
OL,5,Cplans
OL,7,FDespite those words, Graftsrom was
OL,8,Fpictured smiling alongside Infantino
OL,9,Fat a football match in Morocco last
OL,10,Fnight following the talks.
OL,12,FIn a statement released after the
OL,13,Fmeeting, Fifa said that members of the
OL,14,Fmanagement board "in attendance"
OL,15,Freaffirmed their full support for
OL,16,FInfantino.
OL,26,@vD@ROUvD@`O]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/7
