OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F311A1786384095
OL,3,CFifa COO excluded from crisis talks
OL,4,Cafter criticism of World Cup sell-off
OL,5,Cplans
OL,7,FWhat the announcement didn't specify
OL,8,Fwere the board members, including
OL,9,FLamour, who weren't there, notably
OL,10,FArsene Wenger, chief of FIFA's global
OL,11,Ffootball development, and chief
OL,12,Ffootball officer Jill Ellis.
OL,14,FDespite the bravado, and the fact that
OL,15,FInfantino probably feels he still has
OL,16,Fthe majority of global FAs on his
OL,17,Fside, it feels like his race is far
OL,18,Ffrom won.
OL,26,@rD@Dqr
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/7
