OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F311A1786384095
OL,3,CFifa COO excluded from crisis talks
OL,4,Cafter criticism of World Cup sell-off
OL,5,Cplans
OL,7,FNone of Fifa's federations has so far
OL,8,Fcommented collectively on Infantino's
OL,9,Fambition to stay in post.
OL,11,FBut Uefa has already called for his
OL,12,Fhead, the English FA, among many
OL,13,Fothers in Europe and America, want him
OL,14,Fgone too, and no amount of diplomacy
OL,15,Fwill change that.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/7
